#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# member

#% text
# `member(xs, x)` gives `true` when `x` is an element of `xs`, compared by identity, else `false`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
member([1, 2, 3], 2)
#% output
#= true

#% cell
member([1, 2, 3], 5)
#% output
#= false

#% subsection
# Scope

#% text
# Identity, not numerical equality:

#% cell
[member([1, 2], 1.0), member([1, 2], 1)]
#% output
#= [false, true]

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `member_of`, `position`, `count`, `select`
